  "question": {
    "text": "A single slit of width <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is illuminated by a monochromatic light of wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;for which first minimum appears at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math> on the screen will be :",
